@anon.b08dd5f4f09c4be6245191ddd275a566.594 = private unnamed_addr constant [353 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for files with multiple trailing blank lines.\0A\0AIn the case of notebooks, this check is applied to\0Aeach cell separately.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0ATrailing blank lines in a file are superfluous.\0A\0AHowever, the last line of the file should end with a newline.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Aspam(1)\\n\\n\\n\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Aspam(1)\\n\0A```\0A", align 1
